---
import QuickFacts from '../../components/QuickFacts.astro';
const faq = [
  { q: "Can StereoBuyers stay anonymous when making an offer on my client's trade-in?", a: "Yes. You can extend our offer to your client as-is or adjust it for your margins, and StereoBuyers can remain anonymous to the client throughout." },
  { q: "What kinds of businesses and professionals does StereoBuyers work with?", a: "A/V companies and high-end stereo equipment resellers, estate managers, insurance companies, underwriters and brokers, and divorce and bankruptcy attorneys and liquidators." },
  { q: "Do you appraise equipment as well as buy it?", a: "Yes. We offer valuation and appraisal services for home stereos, audio and video components, home automation equipment, records, vacuum tubes and various electronics, and we can also buy the equipment outright." },
  { q: "Can you buy old inventory, cables and manuals from my showroom or warehouse?", a: "Yes. We buy trade-ins, outdated stock, AV parts and accessories, audio and video cables, service and instruction manuals, and other miscellaneous items." },
  { q: "How do I start a business partnership with StereoBuyers?", a: "Fill out our quote form, call 718-260-8948, or email info@stereobuyers.com and we will discuss how we can work together." },
];
const jsonLd = `{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "FAQPage",
  "mainEntity": [
${faq.map((f) => `    { "@type": "Question", "name": ${JSON.stringify(f.q)}, "acceptedAnswer": { "@type": "Answer", "text": ${JSON.stringify(f.a)} } }`).join(',\n')}
  ]
}`;
---
<section class='container xxnarrow margin-center'>
  <p class="b2b-intro">In addition to serving individuals looking to sell their pre-owned audio and video equipment, we also collaborate with businesses in a variety of ways. Below is a sampling of our services. <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a> to discuss how we can work together.</p>
  <p class="b2b-cta"><a class="button" href="/get-a-quote/">Get a free quote</a> <span>or call <a href="tel:+17182608948">718-260-8948</a></span></p>
</section>

<section class='container narrow margin-center b2b-section'>
  <h2 class="text-align-center as-h3">A/V Companies and High-End Stereo Equipment Resellers</h2>
  <p class="text-align-center">There are multiple opportunities for StereoBuyers to help your Audio/Video business grow and operate smoothly.</p>
  <ul class="b2b-cards">
    <li>
      <h3>Client Trade-Ins</h3>
      <p>Looking for a powerful sales and negotiating tool? Let StereoBuyers make you an offer on stereo equipment that your client wants to trade in. You are welcome to extend the offer to your client as-is, or adjust the offer to account for your margins. Either way, StereoBuyers can remain anonymous to the client throughout.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Direct Referrals</h3>
      <p>Are you selling audio and home theater gear and don't want to deal with trade-ins at all? Refer your clients with trade-in equipment directly to us and eliminate the hassle completely.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Audiophile Trade-in Events</h3>
      <p>StereoBuyers can help you stimulate new business. Together we can leverage your client list to promote and host a “trade-in, trade-up” event. We have helped generate tremendous sales with these events in the past.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Cleaning House</h3>
      <p>Let StereoBuyers turn your old inventory and leftovers into cash! We can help you clear the clutter out of your showroom or warehouse by buying your trade-ins, outdated stock, AV parts and accessories, audio and video cables, service and instruction manuals, and other miscellaneous items.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section class='container narrow margin-center b2b-section'>
  <h2 class="text-align-center as-h3">Estate Managers, Insurers and Attorneys</h2>
  <ul class="b2b-cards">
    <li>
      <h3>Estate Managers</h3>
      <p>StereoBuyers offers estate managers valuation and appraisal services for home stereos, audio and video components, home automation equipment, music/LPs/records, vacuum tubes and various electronics. Additionally, we buy equipment outright.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Insurance Companies, Underwriters and Brokers</h3>
      <p>StereoBuyers can assist you in evaluating and appraising the condition and value of your clients’ equipment.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      <h3>Divorce &amp; Bankruptcy Attorneys &amp; Liquidators</h3>
      <p>Let us help you and your clients evaluate audio and theater equipment value. StereoBuyers can also turn pre-owned high-end audio, video and stereo equipment into cash for your clients.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</section>











<section class='brand-faq container xxnarrow margin-center autospacing-next'>
  <h2 class="text-align-center as-h4">Business questions, answered</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>{faq[0].q}</dt><dd>{faq[0].a}</dd>
    <dt>{faq[1].q}</dt><dd>{faq[1].a}</dd>
    <dt>{faq[2].q}</dt><dd>{faq[2].a}</dd>
    <dt>{faq[3].q}</dt><dd>{faq[3].a}</dd>
    <dt>{faq[4].q}</dt><dd>{faq[4].a}</dd>
  </dl>
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={jsonLd} />

<section class='container xxnarrow margin-top-4'>
  <p>Related: <a href="/get-a-quote/">get a free quote</a>, <a href="/how-to-sell-your-high-end-audio-equipment-and-components-with-StereoBuyers/">how selling to us works</a>, <a href="/stereo-equipment-and-components-we-buy/">brands we buy</a>, or <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
</section>

